## SQ-VS-01 | vine shearing mixin, flower vine models
@group A
@commands Boot
@pass `Done (`; no mixin error naming `VineBlockShearMixin`; no blockstate/model warning for `floralench:*_vine` or `botania:solid_vine`
@fails Mixin error: SRG names `m_7926_` / `m_213898_`; a model warning means a variant file names every property and needs `fertile`
@from batches/r1106spf/b1.qb passed
bootreject (Mixin apply failed|InvalidInjectionException).*VineBlockShearMixin
bootreject (?i)(missing|exception).*(floralench:[a-z_]*vine|botania:solid_vine)

## SQ-VS-02 | sheared flower vine stays put, unsheared spreads (90 random ticks, was 60 s at randomTickSpeed 300; also runs SQ-VS-03)
@group A
@commands Stone wall 8 high; `/setblock` at the top on its face `floralench:poppy_vine[north=true,fertile=false]` and 6 blocks along `floralench:poppy_vine[north=true]`
@pass Sheared: still one block (`/execute if block ... floralench:poppy_vine[fertile=false]`); unsheared: has grown down or sideways
@fails Sheared one grew: the randomTick cancel is not applied (check the mixin loaded)
@from batches/r1106spf/b1.qb
@reviewed 2026-11-16
# self-contained since r1118 (judge-3, 2026-11-18): bot spawn from r1106spf b1 setup
> execute unless entity qa run pbot spawn qa -20 -60 -24 minecraft:overworld survival
sleep 3
> setblock 10 -53 9 floralench:poppy_vine[south=true,fertile=false]
> setblock 16 -53 9 floralench:poppy_vine[south=true]
# ceiling above the weeping vines (judge-13, 2026-11-18): SQ-VS-03's setup names one; r1118 without it: the age-0 tip never grew
> setblock 20 -50 10 minecraft:stone
> setblock 26 -50 10 minecraft:stone
> setblock 20 -51 10 minecraft:weeping_vines[age=25]
> setblock 26 -51 10 minecraft:weeping_vines[age=0]
> tp qa 15 -60 5
# 90 random ticks per block = the old 60 s at randomTickSpeed 300 (300 / 4096 x 1200)
> cdevtest randomtick 9 -60 9 27 -50 10 90
waitlog verb=randomtick done= 120
> execute if block 10 -53 9 floralench:poppy_vine[fertile=false]
> execute if block 10 -54 9 minecraft:air
> execute if block 9 -53 9 minecraft:air
> execute if block 11 -53 9 minecraft:air
> execute if block 16 -54 9 floralench:poppy_vine
count Test passed >= 4
reject \[cdevtest\] verb=\S+ done=0
look the last answer (unsheared grew down) may fail if it spread sideways instead: the poppy_vine count in the next row decides

## SQ-VS-03 | weeping vine age 25 does not grow, age 0 does
@group A
@commands `/setblock` `minecraft:weeping_vines[age=25]` and `minecraft:weeping_vines[age=0]` under a ceiling 10 up, 6 apart
@pass age 25: still one block; age 0: grown down
@fails Vanilla, not this feature: re-read `GrowingPlantHeadBlock#isRandomlyTicking`
@from batches/r1106spf/b1.qb
@reviewed 2026-11-16
> cdevtest count 13 -60 9 19 -53 9 floralench:poppy_vine
> execute if block 20 -52 10 minecraft:air
> execute if block 26 -52 10 minecraft:weeping_vines_plant
count Test passed == 2
expect verb=count block=floralench:poppy_vine n=([2-9]|\d{2,})\b
reject \[cdevtest\] verb=\S+ done=0

## SQ-VS-04 | flower vine default state is fertile
@group A
@commands `/setblock ~ ~ ~ floralench:poppy_vine` (no properties)
@pass Placed state has `fertile=true` (`/execute if block ... [fertile=true]`)
@fails Default flipped: a vine constructor sets defaults from a state with `fertile=false`; set it in the mixin
@from batches/r1106spf/b1.qb passed
> fill 10 -60 10 18 -53 10 minecraft:stone
> setblock 18 -58 9 floralench:poppy_vine
> execute if block 18 -58 9 floralench:poppy_vine[fertile=true]
expect Test passed
